ht="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value='&lt;b&gt;proxy · caddy:2.11&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#8b93a7"&gt;:8080 → erp-1, erp-2 · round-robin · health_uri /api/health · X-Gespro-Instancia&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b1c30;strokeColor=#0b1c30;fontColor=#ffffff;arcSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="320" y="40" width="300" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value='&lt;b&gt;erp-1 · gespro-erp:local&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#8b93a7"&gt;Next standalone · não-root · HEALTHCHECK · entrypoint: prisma migrate deploy&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2257d8;fontColor=#0b1c30;arcSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="320" y="150" width="300" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value='&lt;b&gt;erp-2 · gespro-erp:local&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#8b93a7"&gt;mesma imagem — prova sessão, limitador partilhado e publicação em duas fases&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2257d8;fontColor=#0b1c30;arcSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="660" y="150" width="300" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value='&lt;b&gt;keycloak · 26.7.0&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#8b93a7"&gt;:8081 (só 127.0.0.1) · realm importado de infra/keycloak · consola não pública&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b1c30;strokeColor=#0b1c30;fontColor=#ffffff;arcSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="660" y="40" width="300" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value='&lt;b&gt;db · postgres:17-alpine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#8b93a7"&gt;:5432 · BD gespro + BD keycloak (db-init) · 